WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:07.800
Read the ratings by place, take a ticket, record what was done and close it.

2
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:15.510
Shoppers scan a poster anywhere in the mall, rate it and leave a comment. No app, no sign-in.

3
00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:24.470
The average rating, how many would recommend the mall, the tickets still open and how fast they get a first answer.

4
00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:28.900
By location, worst first, tells you where to act.

5
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.910
Low ratings and comments become tickets.

6
00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:36.290
Open one.

7
00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:44.830
What the shopper said, where, and where it was sent. A cleanliness complaint goes straight to cleaning as an alert.

8
00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:48.910
Set the status and who handles it.

9
00:00:51.520 --> 00:01:00.250
Write what was done. The time to the first action is measured, so answer quickly.

10
00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:03.350
Save.

11
00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:12.860
Each place has its own poster and link. Add a place here and link it to a cleaning area.

12
00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:17.030
Then print the posters and put them up.
